            <div xml:id="d554">

                <pb facs="0731" n="637" sameAs="frus:frus1924v02/pg637"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">871.6363/239: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Chargé in Rumania</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Riggs</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-10-28T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 28,
                                1924—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>47. Suggestion in last sentence of your telegram 72 of October 21 is approved.
                    However, should a satisfactory solution not be reached within a reasonable time
                    the Department believes it might be advisable for you to protest in accordance
                    with its 41, September 26, 4 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
